    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING! This game contains bright lights and flashing effects that may cause discomfort and/or seizures for those with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana Smack is a fast-paced, turn-based rogue-lite game where fighters face off in a  best-of-3 match.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike, Guard, or Support</strong>\u00a0- Actions will have different effects based on the skills you equip.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Ultimate!</strong> -\u00a0Turn the tides of battle using your ultimate, a powerful skill that is unique to your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/ed7b0c2c33ccee1c4a75345d6550a723.poster.avif?t=1755117512\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/ed7b0c2c33ccee1c4a75345d6550a723.webm?t=1755117512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/ed7b0c2c33ccee1c4a75345d6550a723.mp4?t=1755117512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outmatch or Outlast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches have two distinct win conditions!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win via Knock Out</strong> - Reduce your opponent's HP to zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win via High Score -</strong>\u00a0Accumulate more points than your opponent by the end of the round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/ccbf7337207ccb295d5abe40add05fb5.poster.avif?t=1755117512\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/ccbf7337207ccb295d5abe40add05fb5.webm?t=1755117512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/ccbf7337207ccb295d5abe40add05fb5.mp4?t=1755117512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Countless Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana Smack has a multitude of unique characters to play as or against.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fighting Style -</strong>\u00a0Mix and match over a hundred different skills and abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Run, New Challenge</strong> - Each run will have a new set of skills to choose from and a new set of enemies to face.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/7b3248cc3ed0eed02700ca6ac1620ec0.poster.avif?t=1755117512\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/7b3248cc3ed0eed02700ca6ac1620ec0.webm?t=1755117512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680600/extras/7b3248cc3ed0eed02700ca6ac1620ec0.mp4?t=1755117512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
